  "body": "#4759 reminded me that there's other places where we mention `a` and `area`, but not SVG `a`, e.g., `:link` or `:active`. I think it would make sense for HTML to take ownership of that where possible so that SVG does not have to duplicate it.\r\n\r\n(#4831 is somewhat related.)",
